<section id="A1.SS5" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.5 </span>Different metrics analysis</h3>

<div id="A1.SS5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We also calculated different metrics for the evaluation on our multi-omics datasets to gain a comprehensive view and address issues posed by using AUROC only.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T2" class="ltx_table ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center">
<table id="A1.T2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A1.T2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">Dataset</th>
<td id="A1.T2.1.1.2" class="ltx_td"></td>
<td id="A1.T2.1.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right">LGG</td>
<td id="A1.T2.1.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right">OV</td>
<td id="A1.T2.1.1.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right">BRCA</td>
<td id="A1.T2.1.1.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right">SARC</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T2.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">#features</th>
<td id="A1.T2.1.2.2" class="ltx_td"></td>
<td id="A1.T2.1.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right"><math id="A1.SS5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="60{,}664" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>60,664</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">60{,}664</annotation></semantics></math></td>
