<br class="ltx_break ltx_break">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table A3: </span>Average accuracy (<math id="A1.T3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pm" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>±</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pm</annotation></semantics></math>SEM) scores of 4 multiomics datasets (higher is better). We compare TabPFN-Wide, using up to 8k features for continued pre-training (second column), to TabPFNv2 and other baseline methods and boldface the best values for each column.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
