<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure A4: </span>(a) AUROC for TabPFN-Wide-1.5k vs TabPFNv2 on <math id="A1.F4.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="21" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>21</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">21</annotation></semantics></math> TabArena classification tasks with <span id="A1.F4.6" class="ltx_text"><math id="A1.F4.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leq 10{,}000" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mn>10,000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leq 10{,}000</annotation></semantics></math></span> samples and <span id="A1.F4.7" class="ltx_text"><math id="A1.F4.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leq 500" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mn>500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leq 500</annotation></semantics></math></span> features. (b-c) Average AUROC (relative to TabPFNv2 evaluated on the original dataset) on a set of <math id="A1.F4.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="13" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>13</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">13</annotation></semantics></math> widened datasets: (b) <span id="A1.F4.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">needle-in-a-haystack</span> and (c) <span id="A1.F4.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">features-smearing</span>. (d) TabPFN-Wide-1.5k’s performance for different sparsities. <math id="A1.F4.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p=0</annotation></semantics></math> corresponds to TabPFN-Wide-1.5k’s curve in (b), and <math id="A1.F4.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p=0.02" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.02</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p=0.02</annotation></semantics></math> in (c)</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A1.F5" class="ltx_figure">
